  "notes": "Also functions as a する verb ({厳選|げんせん}する). Very common in advertising, restaurant descriptions, and product marketing to convey premium quality. The past participle form {厳選|げんせん}された is especially frequent.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {厳選|げんせん}された{素材|そざい} — carefully selected materials\n- {厳選|げんせん}{食材|しょくざい} — handpicked ingredients\n- {厳選|げんせん}した{商品|しょうひん} — carefully chosen products\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {選|えら}び{抜|ぬ}く — to select with care (native Japanese equivalent)\n- {精選|せいせん} — careful selection (less common)",
